1-14 09:05", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 09:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 09:12", "history": []}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "她先带借还流程，两小时收工，之后去试伴娘服", "subject": "HER", "relation": "当日安排", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["先带借还流程，两小时收工，完了我去试伴娘服。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 09:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 09:12", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "她带教收工，小隼手生但仔细，便签贴在登记机边上", "subject": "HER", "relation": "带教", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["带教收工，小隼手生但仔细，便签我贴登记机边上了。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:38", "history": []}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "冯荻下午班说新书上架24本", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["冯荻下午班说新书上架 24 本。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:38", "history": []}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "她伴娘服试好了，12月底那场婚礼确定参加", "subject": "HER", "relation": "婚礼", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["伴娘服也试好了，12 月底那场跑不了了。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:38", "history": []}, "f_0040": {"fact_id": "f_0040", "text": "她 11-18 周三晚班是换来的那班", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["周三 11-18 又轮我晚班，换来的那班"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 19:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 19:52", "history": []}, "f_0041": {"fact_id": "f_0041", "text": "她请我在微信上教她登记机卡纸时镊子从哪儿进", "subject": "HER", "relation": "求助", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["登记机卡纸那毛病，镊子该从哪儿进，你微信上教我下"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 19:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 19:52", "history": []}, "f_0042": {"fact_id": "f_0042", "text": "她晚班收工，还书 31 本，借出 9 本", "subject": "HER", "relation": "值班记录", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["晚班收工：还书 31 本，借出 9 本"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 晚班", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:12", "history": []}, "f_0043": {"fact_id": "f_0043", "text": "登记机卡了一回，她按镊子法子处理成功", "subject": "HER", "relation": "设备故障", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["登记机卡了一回，镊子法子管用"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 晚班", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:12", "history": []}, "f_0044": {"fact_id": "f_0044", "text": "儿童角《月亮先生》被撕两页，她已登记破损本", "subject": "HER", "relation": "图书破损", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["儿童角《月亮先生》被人撕了两页，我登记破损本了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 晚班", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:12", "history": []}, "f_0045": {"fact_id": "f_0045", "text": "12-05 第一个周六上午十点到十一点半办雪夜故事会，招主讲", "subject": "HER", "relation": "活动安排", "evidence_uids": [14, 18], "evidence_quotes": ["12-05 第一个周六办雪夜故事会，上午十点到十一点半，招主讲", "故事会黄了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "2026-12-05 10:00-11:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 12:38", "valid_to": "2026-11-30 11:28", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:38", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "12-05 第一个周六上午十点到十一点半办雪夜故事会，招主讲", "valid_to": "2026-11-30 11:28", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [18], "quote": "故事会黄了"}]}, "f_0046": {"fact_id": "f_0046", "text": "她报了雪夜故事会主讲，讲《雪孩子》", "subject": "HER", "relation": "活动安排", "evidence_uids": [14], "evidence_quotes": ["我报了，讲《雪孩子》"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-05", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 12:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:38", "history": []}, "f_0047": {"fact_id": "f_0047", "text": "串词明晚（11-28）发我，帮盯时间不超四十五分钟", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [14, 17], "evidence_quotes": ["串词写完发你帮我看", "串词明晚发你，帮我盯下时间别超四十五分钟。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 18:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0047@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:38", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "串词写完发我帮我看", "valid_to": "2026-11-27 18:48", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [17], "quote": "串词明晚发你，帮我盯下时间别超四十五分钟。"}]}, "f_0048": {"fact_id": "f_0048", "text": "12 月排班表月底出，先排到 12-12，之后等年末清点再定", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [15], "evidence_quotes": ["12 月表月底出，郑老师说先排到 12-12，后头等年末清点再定。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-23", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0049": {"fact_id": "f_0049", "text": "我需在 11-28 那班之前把 12 月意向报给郑老师", "subject": "ME", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [15], "evidence_quotes": ["你 11-28 那班之前把 12 月意向报给她，别漏了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-28 之前", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0050": {"fact_id": "f_0050", "text": "12-12 之后的排班等年末清点再定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [15], "evidence_quotes": ["后头等年末清点再定"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:22", "history": []}, "f_0051": {"fact_id": "f_0051", "text": "12 月表群里发了：12-02 周三晚是梅鹤鸣，12-09 周三晚是蔺初桐，12-05 周六下午是蔺初桐（还冯荻人情那班），12-12 周六下午是梅鹤鸣", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "12月排班", "evidence_uids": [16], "evidence_quotes": ["12 月表群里发了：12-02 周三晚你，12-09 周三晚我，12-05 周六下午我，还冯荻那个人情那班，12-12 周六下午你。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12", "valid_from": "2026-11-25 21:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-25 21:28", "history": []}, "f_0052": {"fact_id": "f_0052", "text": "11-25 晚班收工后，有个小男孩把果汁泼在绘本区，她拖了两遍", "subject": "HER", "relation": "当晚值班", "evidence_uids": [16], "evidence_quotes": ["今晚有个小男孩把果汁泼绘本区了，我拖了两遍"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-25 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-25 21:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-25 21:28", "history": []}, "f_0053": {"fact_id": "f_0053", "text": "她 12-05 全天在馆：上午故事会主讲，下午还人情班", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [17, 18], "evidence_quotes": ["12-05 我全天泡馆里：上午故事会主讲，下午还人情班。", "12-05 全天闭馆检修。故事会黄了，我那个还人情班也取消了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "2026-12-05", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 18:48", "valid_to": "2026-11-30 11:28", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 18:48", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她 12-05 全天在馆：上午故事会主讲，下午还人情班", "valid_to": "2026-11-30 11:28", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [18], "quote": "12-05 全天闭馆检修。故事会黄了，我那个还人情班也取消了"}]}, "f_0054": {"fact_id": "f_0054", "text": "她明晚（11-28）把故事会串词发我", "subject": "HER", "relation": "约定", "evidence_uids": [17], "evidence_quotes": ["串词明晚发你"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-28", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 18:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 18:48", "history": []}, "f_0055": {"fact_id": "f_0055", "text": "故事会串词要控制在四十五分钟以内", "subject": "HER", "relation": "要求", "evidence_uids": [17], "evidence_quotes": ["帮我盯下时间别超四十五分钟"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-05", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 18:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 18:48", "history": []}, "f_0056": {"fact_id": "f_0056", "text": "12-05 全天闭馆检修供暖管道", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "馆里正式通知", "evidence_uids": [18], "evidence_quotes": ["供暖管道老化，12-05 全天闭馆检修"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-05 全天", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 11:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 11:28", "history": []}, "f_0057": {"fact_id": "f_0057", "text": "她的雪夜故事会取消", "subject": "HER", "relation": "活动取消", "evidence_uids": [18], "evidence_quotes": ["故事会黄了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-05 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 11:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 11:28", "history": []}, "f_0058": {"fact_id": "f_0058", "text": "她还冯荻人情的班取消", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班取消", "evidence_uids": [18, 19], "evidence_quotes": ["我那个还人情班也取消了", "我欠冯荻的班挪到 12-19 周六下午，表上登记了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "reopened", "event_time": "2026-12-05 下午", "valid_from": "2026-12-01 19:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 11:28", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她还冯荻人情的班取消", "valid_to": "2026-12-01 19:18", "reason": "reopen", "src_uids": [19], "quote": "我欠冯荻的班挪到 12-19 周六下午，表上登记了"}]}, "f_0059": {"fact_id": "f_0059", "text": "还人情班已定 12-19 周六下午；故事会改期仍在申请，争取下个周六，未定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [18, 19], "evidence_quotes": ["郑老师说改期方案等检修进度", "故事会她去申请改期，争取下个周六，没定前先别当我讲了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-12-01 19:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0059@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 11:28", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "故事会与还人情班的改期方案等检修进度再定", "valid_to": "2026-12-01 19:18", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [19], "quote": "故事会她去申请改期，争取下个周六，没定前先别当我讲了"}]}, "f_0060": {"fact_id": "f_0060", "text": "她欠冯荻的班挪到 12-19 周六下午，表上已登记", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["我欠冯荻的班挪到 12-19 周六下午，表上登记了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-19 下午", "valid_from": "2026-12-01 19:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-01 19:18", "history": []}, "f_0061": {"fact_id": "f_0061", "text": "故事会改期由她去申请", "subject": "HER", "relation": "故事会", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["故事会她去申请改期"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-12-01 19:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-01 19:18", "history": []}, "f_0062": {"fact_id": "f_0062", "text": "故事会改期争取下个周六，未定，定前不当她讲", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["争取下个周六，没定前先别当我讲了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-12-01 19:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-01 19:18", "history": []}, "f_0063": {"fact_id": "f_0063", "text": "她今晚顺路来馆里还书，说给她留杯热水就行，不留也行", "subject": "HER", "relation": "今晚到馆", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["我顺路还书，给我留杯热水就行，不留也行"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-02 晚", "valid_from": "2026-12-02 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-02 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0064": {"fact_id": "f_0064", "text": "她看了梅鹤鸣改的那版串词，说“雪孩子化了别哭它变成云了”这句真好", "subject": "HER", "relation": "故事会串词", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["串词你改的那版我看了，雪孩子化了别哭它变成云了，这句真好"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-02", "valid_from": "2026-12-02 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-02 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0065": {"fact_id": "f_0065", "text": "郑老师在楼道口头说检修进度快，12-05 下午说不定能开门，群里没发", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["12-05 下午说不定能开门"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-12-02 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-02 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0066": {"fact_id": "f_0066", "text": "郑老师中午私信她：12-05 下午大概率能开，问要不要把下午班恢复回来，故事会改 12-12 上午也行", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班/活动变动", "evidence_uids": [21], "evidence_quotes": ["郑老师中午又发我私信：12-05 下午大概率能开，问我要不要把下午班恢复回来，故事会改 12-12 上午也行。"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "2026-12-03 中午", "valid_from": "2026-12-03 12:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-03 12:52", "history": []}, "f_0067": {"fact_id": "f_0067", "text": "郑老师让她等正式通知、别声张", "subject": "HER", "relation": "通知纪律", "evidence_uids": [21], "evidence_quotes": ["她让我等正式通知别声张。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-03 中午", "valid_from": "2026-12-03 12:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-03 12:52", "history": []}, "f_0068": {"fact_id": "f_0068", "text": "她目前先按取消记着 12-05 下午班", "subject": "HER", "relation": "排班记录", "evidence_uids": [21], "evidence_quotes": ["我先按取消记着。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-03", "valid_from": "2026-12-03 12:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-03 12:52", "history": []}, "f_0069": {"fact_id": "f_0069", "text": "12-05 下午班可能恢复，等正式通知", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [21], "evidence_quotes": ["12-05 下午大概率能开，问我要不要把下午班恢复回来"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-12-03 12:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-03 12:52", "history": []}, "f_0070": {"fact_id": "f_0070", "text": "故事会改到 12-12 上午也行，未定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [21], "evidence_quotes": ["故事会改 12-12 上午也行"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-12-03 12:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-03 12:52", "history": []}, "f_0071": {"fact_id": "f_0071", "text": "检修延到下周一完工，12-05 全天闭馆维持不变", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "馆内正式通知", "evidence_uids": [22], "evidence_quotes": ["检修延到下周一完工，12-05 全天闭馆维持不变"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-05 全天", "valid_from": "2026-12-04 17:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-04 17:12", "history": []}, "f_0072": {"fact_id": "f_0072", "text": "故事会正式改到 12-12 周六上午十点到十一点半，主讲还是蔺初桐", "subject": "HER", "relation": "故事会改期已定", "evidence_uids": [22], "evidence_quotes": ["故事会正式改 12-12 周六上午十点到十一点半，主讲还是我"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-12 上午10:00-11:30", "valid_from": "2026-12-04 17:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-04 17:12", "history": []}, "f_0073": {"fact_id": "f_0073", "text": "她已在本子上把 12-05 那栏划掉", "subject": "HER", "relation": "记录处理", "evidence_uids": [22], "evidence_quotes": ["我本子上把 12-05 那栏划了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-04", "valid_from": "2026-12-04 17:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-04 17:12", "history": []}, "f_0074": {"fact_id": "f_0074", "text": "她 12-12 上午主讲故事会，我下午班", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "排班", "evidence_uids": [23], "evidence_quotes": ["上午故事会我主讲，你下午班"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-12", "valid_from": "2026-12-09 21:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-09 21:48", "history": []}, "f_0075": {"fact_id": "f_0075", "text": "登记机钥匙放在老地方信封", "subject": "HER", "relation": "交接", "evidence_uids": [23], "evidence_quotes": ["登记机钥匙在老地方信封"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-12", "valid_from": "2026-12-09 21:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-09 21:48", "history": []}, "f_0076": {"fact_id": "f_0076", "text": "《雪孩子》头饰做了六个，讲完放道具柜", "subject": "HER", "relation": "交接", "evidence_uids": [23], "evidence_quotes": ["《雪孩子》头饰做了六个，讲完放道具柜"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-12", "valid_from": "2026-12-09 21:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-09 21:48", "history": []}, "f_0077": {"fact_id": "f_0077", "text": "绘本区果汁印她用苏打水擦淡了，让我下午班再过一遍", "subject": "HER", "relation": "交接", "evidence_uids": [23], "evidence_quotes": ["绘本区果汁印我用苏打水擦淡了，你下午班再过一遍"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-12", "valid_from": "2026-12-09 21:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-09 21:48", "history": []}, "f_0078": {"fact_id": "f_0078", "text": "她 11 月实际值了两回晚班，加 14 号上午带教两小时，郑老师时长本记了七小时", "subject": "HER", "relation": "志愿时长", "evidence_uids": [24], "evidence_quotes": ["11 月我实际值了两回晚班，加 14 号上午带教两小时，郑老师时长本给我记了七小时，一分不多一分不少"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11", "valid_from": "2026-12-10 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-10 20:38", "history": []}, "f_0079": {"fact_id": "f_0079", "text": "她邀我 12-12 去故事会当观众", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约", "evidence_uids": [24], "evidence_quotes": ["12-12 你来当观众呗，最后一排打瞌睡也行"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-12", "valid_from": "2026-12-10 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-10 20:38", "history": []}, "f_0080": {"fact_id": "f_0080", "text": "她 12-22 到 28 去杭州驻场，与馆里的班错开", "subject": "HER", "relation": "行程", "evidence_uids": [24], "evidence_quotes": ["12-22 到 28 我去杭州驻场，跟馆里的班正好错开"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-22 至 2026-12-28", "valid_from": "2026-12-10 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-12-10 20:38", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 80, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0013", "action": "complete", "text": "她提出我 11-18 周三晚与她 11-11 周三晚对调", "old_text": "她提出我 11-18 周三晚与她 11-11 周三晚对调", "ts": "2026-11-05 12:28", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "11-11 归你，11-18 归我，改完截图发群里了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0021", "action": "complete", "text": "11-14 下午班由谁顶班尚未确定，她请我在志愿者群里问", "old_text": "11-14 下午班由谁顶班尚未确定，她请我在志愿者群里问", "ts": "2026-11-08 19:48", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "那 11-14 就记她名下"}, {"fact_id": "f_0029", "action": "cancel", "text": "她想把 11-14 周六下午的班从冯荻手里要回来，尚未定", "old_text": "她想把 11-14 周六下午的班从冯荻手里要回来，尚未定", "ts": "2026-11-10 10:38", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "那就不折腾了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0028", "action": "complete", "text": "她明天自己去跟郑老师说", "old_text": "她明天自己去跟郑老师说", "ts": "2026-11-10 10:38", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "郑老师把话递死了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0025", "action": "complete", "text": "下个月冯荻的班她顶一次抵", "old_text": "下个月冯荻的班她顶一次抵", "ts": "2026-11-25 21:28", "src_uids": [16], "quote": "12-05 周六下午我，还冯荻那个人情那班"}, {"fact_id": "f_0047", "action": "correct", "text": "串词明晚（11-28）发我，帮盯时间不超四十五分钟", "old_text": "串词写完发我帮我看", "ts": "2026-11-27 18:48", "src_uids": [17], "quote": "串词明晚发你，帮我盯下时间别超四十五分钟。"}, {"fact_id": "f_0053", "action": "cancel", "text": "她 12-05 全天在馆：上午故事会主讲，下午还人情班", "old_text": "她 12-05 全天在馆：上午故事会主讲，下午还人情班", "ts": "2026-11-30 11:28", "src_uids": [18], "quote": "12-05 全天闭馆检修。故事会黄了，我那个还人情班也取消了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0045", "action": "cancel", "text": "12-05 第一个周六上午十点到十一点半办雪夜故事会，招主讲", "old_text": "12-05 第一个周六上午十点到十一点半办雪夜故事会，招主讲", "ts": "2026-11-30 11:28", "src_uids": [18], "quote": "故事会黄了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0058", "action": "reopen", "text": "她还冯荻人情的班取消", "old_text": "她还冯荻人情的班取消", "ts": "2026-12-01 19:18", "src_uids": [19], "quote": "我欠冯荻的班挪到 12-19 周六下午，表上登记了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0059", "action": "correct", "text": "还人情班已定 12-19 周六下午；故事会改期仍在申请，争取下个周六，未定", "old_text": "故事会与还人情班的改期方案等检修进度再定", "ts": "2026-12-01 19:18", "src_uids": [19], "quote": "故事会她去申请改期，争取下个周六，没定前先别当我讲了"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}